  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme funded role  - Monitoring and Results officer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The budget allocated for this is to cover salary and supporting expenses (allowed under PrOF) for programme-funded role - Monitoring and Results Officer, Ukraine (HEO) , as per approved VERITAS business case. This role is critical to ensuring that BEK&#x2019;s expanding portfolio delivers internal monitoring and results responsibilities to a high standard.</narrative>
  </description>
